OL,3,GNEWSARed kite found dead in
OL,4,AAberdeenshire was killed in 'cruel
OL,5,Apoisoning'
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice say a red kite found dead in
OL,8,FAberdeenshire earlier this year had
OL,9,Fbeen poisoned.
OL,11,FA member of the public discovered the
OL,12,Fbird of prey's remains at Morven Hill,
OL,13,Fnear Dinnet, on 30 June.
OL,15,FRed kites are protected under the
OL,16,FWildlife and Countryside Act and it is
OL,17,Fillegal to kill them.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
