OL,3,GNEWSARed kite found dead in
OL,4,AAberdeenshire was killed in 'cruel
OL,5,Apoisoning'
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice Scotland wild crime liaison
OL,8,Fofficer Ann Ashman said: "Poisoning a
OL,9,Fbird or animal is not only cruel and
OL,10,Fcallous, but it can harm other wildlife
OL,11,Fas well as members of the public."
